{"id":"f18e1a1b970311f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos.md","title":"ZFC Logic9 Classifying Topos","display":"df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos — ZFC Logic9 Classifying Topos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos — ZFC Logic9 Classifying Topos","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-topos.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos — ZFC Logic9 Classifying Topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78c3be29a4eab0f7\" href=\"?note=78c3be29a4eab0f7\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-topos.md\">../batch15/58-df-topos.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\mathcal E,U\\in V\">\\(T,\\mathcal E,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (宇宙索引的 Grothendieck-topos 谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"78c3be29a4eab0f7\" href=\"?note=78c3be29a4eab0f7\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-topos.md\">../batch15/58-df-topos.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeometricTheory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{GeometricTheory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (固定元理论中的几何理论判定，参数为理论码与 Grothendieck 宇宙)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GTop}_U\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\in V:\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{GTop}_U\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\in V:\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\\}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cat}_U\">\\(\\mathsf{Cat}_U\\)</span> (相应的 topos 与范畴码元类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Geom}_U(-,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{Mod}_{T,U}(-):\\mathsf{GTop}_U^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}_U\">\\(\\mathrm{Geom}_U(-,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{Mod}_{T,U}(-):\\mathsf{GTop}_U^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}_U\\)</span> (几何态射范畴与内部模型范畴的标准元理论伪函子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PsNatEquiv}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{PsNatEquiv}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> (固定元理论中的伪自然等价关系)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ClassifyingTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ClassifyingTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}classifying\\text{-}topos}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ClassifyingTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{GeometricTheory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,U)\n\\land\\operatorname{PsNatEquiv}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{Geom}_U(-,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{Mod}_{T,U}(-);\\mathsf{GTop}_U^{\\mathrm{op}}\\right)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}classifying\\text{-}topos}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ClassifyingTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{GeometricTheory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,U)\n\\land\\operatorname{PsNatEquiv}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{Geom}_U(-,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{Mod}_{T,U}(-);\\mathsf{GTop}_U^{\\mathrm{op}}\\right)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>分类性质量化所依赖的 Grothendieck 宇宙，并复用上游二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\\)</span>；伪自然等价涉及大范畴，故明确置于元理论而不伪装成一阶 ZFC 内部谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-topos.md","status":"resolved","id":"78c3be29a4eab0f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-topos.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-topos.md","status":"resolved","id":"78c3be29a4eab0f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (宇宙索引的 Grothendieck-topos 谓词, see [[../batch15/58-df-topos.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,\\mathcal E,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GeometricTheory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{GTop}_U\\coloneqq\\{\\mathcal F\\in V:\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cat}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Geom}_U(-,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{Mod}_{T,U}(-):\\mathsf{GTop}_U^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PsNatEquiv}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ClassifyingTopos}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}classifying\\text{-}topos}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9ClassifyingTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{GeometricTheory}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,U)\n\\land\\operatorname{PsNatEquiv}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(\n\\mathrm{Geom}_U(-,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{Mod}_{T,U}(-);\\mathsf{GTop}_U^{\\mathrm{op}}\\right)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GrothendieckTopos}_S(\\mathcal E,U)","display":false}],"bytes":1848,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2490","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos.md|58-df-zfc-logic9-classifying-topos]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","78c3be29a4eab0f7"]}